</h:head><h:body><input ref="/data/intro"><label>MethodMesh capability-chain showcase</label><hint>This revision is wired to the flat return fields demonstrated by the v0.2 submission. Rich evidence stays in canonical JSON. The redacted JPEG is now an ODK image field so Collect can import it as a real instance attachment.</hint></input><group appearance="field-list" intent="com.example.methodmesh.EXECUTE_METHOD(method_id='admin_fingerprint_confirmation',input_payload_mode='FULL',return_mode='flat',methodmesh_return_namespace='auth')" ref="/data/auth_group"><label>Unlock showcase</label><input ref="/data/auth_group/auth_confirmed" appearance="hidden-answer"><label>Authentication confirmed</label></input><input ref="/data/auth_group/auth_auth_method" appearance="hidden-answer"><label>Authentication method</label></input><input ref="/data/auth_group/auth_timestamp_ms" appearance="hidden-answer"><label>Authentication timestamp (ms)</label></input><input ref="/data/auth_group/auth_timestamp_iso" appearance="hidden-answer"><label>Authentication time</label></input><input ref="/data/auth_group/auth_reason" appearance="hidden-answer"><label>Authentication reason</label></input><input ref="/data/auth_group/auth_message" appearance="hidden-answer"><label>Authentication message</label></input><input ref="/data/auth_group/auth_methodmesh_full_json" appearance="hidden-answer"><label>Authentication JSON</label></input></group><input ref="/data/auth_success"><label>✓ Device authentication succeeded</label><hint> Method: <output value=" /data/auth_group/auth_auth_method "/> · <output value=" /data/auth_group/auth_timestamp_iso "/> </hint></input><input ref="/data/auth_failed"><label>Authentication was not completed</label><hint>The rest of the form is unavailable until local authentication succeeds.</hint></input><group ref="/data/showcase_body"><label>MethodMesh showcase</label><input ref="/data/showcase_body/basic_intro"><label>1 · Ordinary ODK questions</label><hint>Three conventional XLSForm fields before the MethodMesh capability chain.</hint></input><input ref="/data/showcase_body/showcase_id"><label>Showcase run label</label><hint>Use a short pseudonymous label, e.g. DEMO-001.</hint></input><input ref="/data/showcase_body/age_years"><label>Age in years</label></input><select1 ref="/data/showcase_body/favourite_colour" appearance="minimal"><label>Choose a colour</label><itemset nodeset="instance('demo_colour')/root/item"><value ref="name"/><label ref="label"/></itemset></select1><input ref="/data/showcase_body/short_note"><label>One-line note</label></input><input ref="/data/showcase_body/photo_intro"><label>2 · Capture and redact a photograph</label><hint>The returned redacted JPEG should be imported into this ODK instance as an attachment.</hint></input><group appearance="field-list" intent="com.example.methodmesh.EXECUTE_METHOD(method_id='image.redact',input_payload_mode='FULL',return_mode='flat',methodmesh_return_namespace='photo')" ref="/data/showcase_body/photo_group"><label>Redacted photograph</label><upload ref="/data/showcase_body/photo_group/photo_redacted_image_uri" mediatype="image/*"><label>Redacted photograph</label><hint>This should become a real ODK attachment after the MethodMesh return.</hint></upload><input ref="/data/showcase_body/photo_group/photo_redacted_image_sha256" appearance="hidden-answer"><label>Redacted image SHA-256</label></input><input ref="/data/showcase_body/photo_group/photo_methodmesh_closeout_status" appearance="hidden-answer"><label>Redaction status</label></input><input ref="/data/showcase_body/photo_group/photo_methodmesh_full_json" appearance="hidden-answer"><label>Full image-redaction JSON</label></input></group><input ref="/data/showcase_body/photo_summary"><label> Photo redaction: <output value=" /data/showcase_body/photo_group/photo_methodmesh_closeout_status "/> </label><hint> Attachment hash: <output value=" /data/showcase_body/photo_group/photo_redacted_image_sha256 "/> </hint></input><input ref="/data/showcase_body/location_intro"><label>3 · Capture a Plus Code</label><hint>Keep the useful Plus Code and success status flat; location detail remains in the canonical JSON.</hint></input><group appearance="field-list" intent="com.example.methodmesh.EXECUTE_METHOD(method_id='plus_code.capture',input_payload_mode='FULL',return_mode='flat',methodmesh_return_namespace='location')" ref="/data/showcase_body/location_group"><label>Capture location</label><input ref="/data/showcase_body/location_group/location_plus_code_status" appearance="hidden-answer"><label>Location status</label></input><input ref="/data/showcase_body/location_group/location_plus_code"><label>Plus Code</label></input><input ref="/data/showcase_body/location_group/location_methodmesh_full_json" appearance="hidden-answer"><label>Full Plus Code JSON</label></input></group><input ref="/data/showcase_body/location_summary"><label> Location: <output value=" /data/showcase_body/location_group/location_plus_code "/> </label><hint> MethodMesh status: <output value=" /data/showcase_body/location_group/location_plus_code_status "/> </hint></input><input ref="/data/showcase_body/polygon_intro"><label>4 · Select a region on an SVG</label><hint>Show one compact returned value; retain the selection history and audit hash in canonical JSON.</hint></input><group appearance="field-list" intent="com.example.methodmesh.EXECUTE_METHOD(method_id='svg.select',input_payload_mode='FULL',return_mode='flat',methodmesh_return_namespace='polygon')" ref="/data/showcase_body/polygon_group"><label>SVG polygon selection</label><input ref="/data/showcase_body/polygon_group/polygon_value"><label>Selected region</label></input><input ref="/data/showcase_body/polygon_group/polygon_methodmesh_closeout_status" appearance="hidden-answer"><label>Selection status</label></input><input ref="/data/showcase_body/polygon_group/polygon_methodmesh_full_json" appearance="hidden-answer"><label>Full SVG-selection JSON</label></input></gro